msgid "按远程分配代理。「不代理」= 不设置 RCGUI 的远程级代理，rclone 仍可能继承系统的 HTTP_PROXY / HTTPS_PROXY 环境变量，不等于强制直连。代理只在远程建立连接时生效：正在运行的挂载/服务需要重新挂载或重启才会使用新代理。ftp / sftp 使用 rclone 原生 http_proxy / socks_proxy 键；若该远程自己已设了代理，本程序只补空缺、不会覆盖（rclone 优先使用 socks_proxy）。SOCKS 的账号密码以明文写入 rclone.conf，且密码不能包含「@」、用户名不能包含「:」。"
msgstr "Assign a proxy per remote. \"No proxy\" means no RCGUI remote-level proxy; rclone may still inherit the system HTTP_PROXY / HTTPS_PROXY environment variables, so it is not a forced direct connection. A proxy only takes effect when the remote connects: running mounts/services must be remounted or restarted to use the new proxy. ftp / sftp use rclone's native http_proxy / socks_proxy keys; if the remote already sets a proxy, RCGUI only fills the gaps and never overrides it (rclone prefers socks_proxy). SOCKS credentials are written to rclone.conf in plain text, the password must not contain \"@\", and the user name must not contain \":\"."

